These systems run unattended all the time without consoles connected, and this one has been used with 1.6 NetBSD alpha for the last two years or so. In that time I have started it many times without a console cable.

Between running 1.6 and 2.0 I installed a new secondary disk (sd1 in this configuration) and installed 2.0 on the disk which originally had 1.6. These were the only changes I made.

One thing which I will try is to install 2.0 on my other dec3000 system. This should resolve any hardware/software issue.

> If there's nothing connected to the port then it would be well within
