>From freza@merlot.ics.muni.cz Mon Jan 24 19:33:04 2005
>Date: Tue, 25 Jan 2005 04:32:10 +0100
>From: Jachym Holecek <freza@liberouter.org>
>To: List Mail User <track@Plectere.com>
